# Auth & session

Read `.cursor/skills/studyverce-auth/SKILL.md` before editing these files.

## Non-negotiables

1. **`middleware.ts` `config.matcher`** — static string array only; never import/spread from `middleware-routes.ts`.
2. **`/auth/reset-password`** — allowlisted in `safeRedirectPath` and exempt from logged-in auth redirect in middleware.
3. **Email templates** — inline base64 logo; regenerate via `./scripts/sync-email-logo.sh`; wire in `supabase/config.toml`.
4. **Navbar** — no blocking server auth in layout; use `navbar-interactive.tsx`.

## When changing matcher paths

Update both:

- `apps/web/src/middleware.ts` (literal matcher)
- `lib/auth/middleware-routes.ts` (`isProtectedAppPath` logic)

Then run `pnpm --filter web exec tsc --noEmit`.
